  "question": {
    "text": "A couple is of moment $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{G}}$ and the force forming the couple is $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}}$. If $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}}$ is turned through a right angle the moment of the couple thus formed is $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}}$. If instead, the force $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}}$ are turned through an angle $\\alpha$, then the moment of couple becomes",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "iiV14",
      "text": "\n$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}} \\sin \\alpha-\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{G}} \\cos \\alpha$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AU7EG",
      "text": "\n$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{G}} \\sin \\alpha-\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}} \\cos \\alpha$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "8Vq6B",
      "text": "\n$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}} \\sin \\alpha+\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{G}} \\cos \\alpha$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nQkGB",
      "text": "\n$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{G}} \\sin \\alpha+\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}} \\cos \\alpha$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}=\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{p}} ;|\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}|=\\mathrm{rp} \\sin \\theta$\n$|\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}}|=\\operatorname{rpcos} \\theta \\quad\\left[\\because \\sin \\left(90^{\\circ}+\\theta\\right)=\\cos \\theta\\right\\rfloor$\n$\\mathrm{G}=\\mathrm{rp} \\sin \\theta$    <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bZ2TMQvs7yvx903HbGehOo03z84s2gZes4IsJKhUDpc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\mathrm{H}=\\mathrm{rp} \\cos \\theta$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/oaeImHZfMjatvwKqHOebcDpCsYNWNKqq4JHN5K6GPHM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\mathrm{x}=\\mathrm{rp} \\sin (\\theta+\\alpha)$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5Q2DxuZaYX-BHM-iis7RZtLZP2jU170OhxaeMOVnVHA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nFrom (1), (2) \\& (3),\n$\\mathrm{x}=\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}} \\cos \\alpha+\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}} \\sin \\alpha$",
    "image": null
  },
